sen0414:Ch01Research a res:ResearchProject ;
    rdfs:label "Python basics for an advanced course: chapter 1 of the 3rd edition and the Python students now run"@en ;
    dcterms:abstract "A review of the 3rd edition's chapter 1 against the current Python documentation, Python Enhancement Proposals and the 2025 state of the ecosystem, to renew the SEN0414 chapter 1 deck for an advanced course." ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts taken from the textbook ontology built over the published chapter. Then the official documentation for the current release, the PEPs the chapter's topics touch, the release schedule, and two measures of the ecosystem. Every source opened and its title read on 2026-09-24T20:31:40; every claim below taken from text actually read, none from memory. Added in 1.1.0: sources P15 to P25, each opened and its title read on 2026-10-01T17:51:00, read for the definitions of the terms the chapter text used without defining them." ;
    res:hasResearchScope sen0414:Ch01Scope ;
    rdfs:member sen0414:P01, sen0414:P02, sen0414:P03, sen0414:P04, sen0414:P05, sen0414:P06, sen0414:P07, sen0414:P08, sen0414:P09, sen0414:P10, sen0414:P11, sen0414:P12, sen0414:P13, sen0414:P14, sen0414:P15, sen0414:P16, sen0414:P17, sen0414:P18, sen0414:P19, sen0414:P20, sen0414:P21, sen0414:P22, sen0414:P23, sen0414:P24, sen0414:P25 .

sen0414:Ch01Scope a res:ResearchScope ;
    res:hasResearchQuestion "What does chapter 1 of the 3rd edition teach, and what must an advanced course add so that it matches the Python students will run in 2026?" ;
    res:hasInclusionCriterion "The primary source; official Python documentation for the current release; PEPs on the chapter's topics; the official release schedule; widely cited ecosystem measures." ;
    res:hasExclusionCriterion "Blog posts, tutorials by third parties, and any source not opened and read." ;
    res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-09-24." .

